{"id":"cbb370bf4db323fd","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-eq-validity.md","title":"条件等式的局部有效性","display":"df-equational-validity — 条件等式的局部有效性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-eq-validity","aliases":["16-df-eq-validity","Validity of equations"],"display":"df-equational-validity — 条件等式的局部有效性","depends_on":["[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","[[16-df-algebraic-model]]"],"source":"§3.3 pp.183–185 (PDF203–205); equaliser semantics expanded by test arrows","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-eq-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-eq-validity</span><span>Validity of equations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equational-validity — 条件等式的局部有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714c179fab3ebb50\" href=\"?note=714c179fab3ebb50\" title=\"16-df-sigma-equation\">16-df-sigma-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"396e57d7540c9d0e\" href=\"?note=396e57d7540c9d0e\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-model\">16-df-algebraic-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§3.3 pp.183–185 (PDF203–205); equaliser semantics expanded by test arrows"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)\">\\(\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"396e57d7540c9d0e\" href=\"?note=396e57d7540c9d0e\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-model\">16-df-algebraic-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\">\\(E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714c179fab3ebb50\" href=\"?note=714c179fab3ebb50\" title=\"16-df-sigma-equation\">16-df-sigma-equation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta=((\\tau_i,u_i,v_i))_{i=1}^n\">\\(\\Theta=((\\tau_i,u_i,v_i))_{i=1}^n\\)</span>；项的解释采用本页直接依赖的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_N\">\\(⟦-⟧_N\\)</span>，省略由句法唯一确定的语境与型属下标。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的 Hom 均取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(K,N\\Gamma))\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{i=1}^n\\bigl(⟦ u_i⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ v_i⟧_N\\circ h\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow⟦ s⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ t⟧_N\\circ h\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(K,N\\Gamma))\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{i=1}^n\\bigl(⟦ u_i⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ v_i⟧_N\\circ h\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow⟦ s⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ t⟧_N\\circ h\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models(\\Gamma,(),\\sigma,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ s⟧_N=⟦ t⟧_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models(\\Gamma,(),\\sigma,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ s⟧_N=⟦ t⟧_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿把条件有效性写成“前提在整个语境上的解释箭头全都相等，便推出结论箭头相等”；这遗漏前提只在子对象上成立的情况。本页用所有测试箭头表达局部成立；有有限极限时等价于原书的“前提等化子的交包含于结论等化子”。在 Set 中也等价于逐赋值条件成立。</p>\n<p>反例检验：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(B)\">\\(\\Gamma=(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 中，前提为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=0\">\\(x=0\\)</span>、结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=0\">\\(1=0\\)</span>。前提箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_B\\)</span> 与常值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 并不全局相等，旧蕴含式因前件为假而误判有效；取指向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:1\\to B\">\\(h:1\\to B\\)</span>，新定义正确判为无效。空前提时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\operatorname{id}_{N\\Gamma}\">\\(h=\\operatorname{id}_{N\\Gamma}\\)</span> 得箭头相等，反向由复合立即成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-sigma-equation","status":"resolved","id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-model","status":"resolved","id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-model","status":"resolved","id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-model]]；$E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)$ 满足 [[16-df-sigma-equation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-sigma-equation","status":"resolved","id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-model]]；$E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)$ 满足 [[16-df-sigma-equation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)","display":false},{"tex":"E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta=((\\tau_i,u_i,v_i))_{i=1}^n","display":false},{"tex":"⟦-⟧_N","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"N\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(K,N\\Gamma))\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{i=1}^n\\bigl(⟦ u_i⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ v_i⟧_N\\circ h\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow⟦ s⟧_N\\circ h=⟦ t⟧_N\\circ h\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"N\\models(\\Gamma,(),\\sigma,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ s⟧_N=⟦ t⟧_N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x=0","display":false},{"tex":"1=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_B","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"h:1\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"h=\\operatorname{id}_{N\\Gamma}","display":false}],"bytes":1958,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e86f89884c626ed","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Set 的两个箭头有相同源靶，故箭头相等当且仅当底层函数图相等；函数外延性给出逐赋值的末式。空语境和空载体均由上游语境解释处理；当 $M\\Gamma$ 为空时逐赋值条件真空成立，两个同源靶的空函数也相等。本页只处理无前提的代数等式；带条件等式的局部有效性见 [[16-df-eq-validity]]。"},{"id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本页按原书 Definition3.2.1 修正为简单多型条件等式，撤去原稿误接的 DTT 签名/依赖项/模型。型正确性现在是双向定义，而非只断言一个未定义的 Eqn 名称。模型有效性另见 [[16-df-eq-validity]]；零个前提即代数等式。旧的 $(\\Gamma;\\vec M=\\vec M'\\Rightarrow N=N')$ 是该五元组的显示变体，不额外引入第二套语法。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-validity|df-equational-validity — 条件等式的局部有效性]]"}],"outgoing":["714c179fab3ebb50","396e57d7540c9d0e"]}